{"meta":{"ph":"ˈstedi; NAmE ˈstedi","pos":"adjective","stars":"★"},"defs":[{"def":"developing, growing, etc. gradually and in an even and regular way （发展、增长等）稳步的，持续的，匀速的","ex":[{"s":"I might be able to get attention ___7___, but you have the strength for steady growth.","src":"2026北京卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"我也许能引起注____7____意 但你有稳定成长的力量"},{"s":"The steady improvement in her taste.","src":"2023天津6月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"她的品味不断提高"}]},{"def":"not changing and not interrupted 稳定的；恒定的","ex":[]},{"def":"firmly fixed, supported or balanced; not shaking or likely to fall down 稳的；平稳的；稳固的","ex":[]},{"def":"sensible; who can be relied on 人","ex":[]},{"def":"to stop yourself/sb/sth from moving, shaking or falling; to stop moving, shaking or falling 使稳；使平稳；稳住","ex":[{"s":"Of course, I would like to have more freedom with money and no doubt I will be getting a credit card at some point, but I currently don’t have a steady income, so getting a credit card might tempt me to spend more money than I have!","src":"外研社B5 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"当然,我想用钱有更大的自由,而且毫无疑问,我会在某个时候获得信用卡,但我目前没有稳定的收入,所以获得信用卡可能诱惑我花费比我拥有的更多钱!"},{"s":"The pipe’s steady drip onto the tree’s roots was giving it just enough water at the perfect rate to grow strong and quickly.","src":"人教选必1 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"水管稳定地滴在树根上,"},{"s":"The first was the steady state theory, which holds that the universe has no beginning or end.","src":"人教选必2 U1","cat":"renjiao","t":"第一个是稳态理论,认为宇宙没有开始或结束."},{"s":"The biggest champion of the steady state concept was Fred and in the 1940s, he and several other people founded the Jet Propulsion Laboratory, now one of NASA’s leading space-exploration centres.","src":"人教选必2 U1","cat":"renjiao","t":"稳态概念的最大冠军是弗雷德,在20世纪40年代,他和其他几个人建立了喷气推进实验室,现在是美国航天局领先的太空探索中心之一."},{"s":"It is the first movement of an approach towards that state of mental purity which alone can fit us for a full and steady perception of moral beauty as well as physical adaptation.","src":"译林B3 U4","cat":"yilin","t":"这是实现这种精神纯洁状态办法的第一项运动,它本身就能够使我们充分、稳定地认识道德美以及身体适应。"}]},{"def":"to stop changing and become regular again 恢复平稳；稳定下来","ex":[]},{"def":"to make sb/sth calm 使平静；使冷静；使镇定","ex":[]},{"def":"（要求对方注意言行）哎，注意点","ex":[]},{"def":"（提醒对方小心）注意，当心，小心","ex":[]},{"def":"stomachache ★","ex":[]}]}